Third-party software
--------------------

The search itself uses only the Python standard library, including SQLite,
which is in the public domain. No package has to be installed for it.

Files included in this repository (added with version 0.1.0):

  - app/marked.min.js: marked, a Markdown renderer for the local page.
    Source: https://github.com/markedjs/marked  License: MIT.
    Its license text stays in the file header.

The optional note cards call an AI service with your own key, through Python's
standard library. No AI software is included.
